    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> denote the set of all real values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math> such that the system of equations</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />is inconsistent, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mfenced><mrow><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to</p>",
